<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>Beckhoff-USA-Community.XAE.PLC.Lib.AdsGamepad</id>
    <version>2.3.0</version>
    <title>AdsGamepad PLC Library</title>
    <authors>Beckhoff Automation LLC</authors>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/Beckhoff-USA-Community/ADS-Gamepad-Service</projectUrl>
    <copyright>(c) Beckhoff Automation LLC</copyright>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <license type="file">LICENSE.txt</license>
    <readme>docs/README.md</readme>
    <summary>TwinCAT PLC library for the ADS Gamepad Service</summary>
    <tags>Beckhoff TwinCAT XAE PLC Library AllowMultipleVersions</tags>
    <releaseNotes>Version 2.3.0 makes the version handshake retry until the service answers, so a service that starts after the PLC, for example right after an install, is still recognized without a PLC restart; Unsupported now means the last attempt got no answer and the handshake keeps trying in the background. Version 2.2.1 adds P_Ext_Battery with the charge percent and charging state a 2.6.0 or newer service serves, and 2.1.0 added ReadExtended() with P_Ext_Buttons, P_Touchpad, P_Motion and P_Sequence. Programs that never call ReadExtended behave exactly as before.</releaseNotes>
    <description>AdsGamepad is the TwinCAT 3 PLC library for the ADS Gamepad Service. FB_Gamepad_Controller reads the controller state over ADS every PLC cycle and exposes buttons, sticks, triggers, battery state and rumble through properties, plus the optional extended data of a PlayStation controller. The install puts the library into the XAE library repository, ready to reference, and a copy of the library file under C:\Program Files\Beckhoff USA Community\ADS Gamepad\Library.</description>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="TwinCAT.Standard.XAE" version="0.0.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
    <file src="library\AdsGamepad.library" target="tools\AdsGamepad.library" />
    <file src="docs\README.md" target="docs\README.md" />
    <file src="LICENSE.txt" target="LICENSE.txt" />
  </files>
</package>
